      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから人間は嫌いなんだ……\r\nまさに卑怯・卑屈・卑劣の極まりよ。",
        "official_en": "I now remember why I loathe you humans so. Such uncivil, uncouth, uncultivated creatures.",
        "real_en": "This is why I hate humans... Cowardly, cringing, and utterly despicable!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
