        "official_en_sha256": "8fe5e5474179d5d445c6cc7c1f6d89a62103c256ae2b6d3c4a11f65a2b000bd5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "我の睡眠を邪魔しないように\r\nせいぜい地上の平定に励めよ！",
        "official_en": "You may keep the peace on the surface as you see fit. However, know well that <text style=\"italic\">nothing</> shall disturb my rest!",
        "real_en": "Do your best to keep the peace up above, so you won't disturb my sleep!"
      },
      "review": {
