        "official_en_sha256": "c0bc6939c809278792fb5d2c19d22f1f0f51d9e83c03d1224257d067feaa2a1c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "本気を出せば我のほうが強い。",
        "official_en": "Were I to have unleashed my true power, victory would have been mine.",
